[0.000, "o", "\r\nWHAT THE DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINED\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  correct verdict: NAME THE CAUSE\r\n  planted cause: Nine accounts closed won last quarter. Only three of them -- Globex, Hooli and Wonka Industries -- have produced a single product event since. The other six, carrying $810,000 of the $1,230,000 closed, have never appeared in the product at all. Total event volume is flat and healthy, which is why neither source shows this on its own.\r\n  decoys placed to mislead: usage is healthy, all accounts are active, every account is using, no activation problem\r\n  signals a correct answer names: any of [6 of, six of, 6 of the 9, six of the nine, 3 of, three of], any of [Northwind, Initech, Umbrella, Soylent, Vandelay, Cyberdyne]\r\n"]
